{"4487350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Royal Institute of Magic", "steam_appid": 4487350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been granted the privilege to attend a magical institution as a college age student, but that privilege has to be earned every day. Play with up to 4 players in a team and compete with other teams in magical classes and clubs to earn points for your team. The best teams will be allowed to continue to the next game day and study advanced topics. All other teams will have to return to the first game day and start over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAGICAL CLASSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes are taught and graded by the teachers of the institute. In every class you will learn a new magical skill and then proceed to apply this skill to earn points for your team. The following subjects are taught at the institute</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combative Magic: Learn spells to defend yourself against other witches and wizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemical Studies: Brew magical potions to gain special, temporary buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repulsion of Monsters: Study a variety of monsters that you may face when exploring the institute and learn to repel them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulative Magic: Study magic that allows you to alter the environment to your advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/74ff5ac6d0d1623706c6fecddfe638f3.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/74ff5ac6d0d1623706c6fecddfe638f3.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/74ff5ac6d0d1623706c6fecddfe638f3.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL MAGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <i>no</i> health points. Each spell has a unique effect and you will often have to combine different spells to defeat other players or monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spell has a unique pattern that has to be drawn to cast that spell. There are no short-cuts. The better you master the spell patterns, the faster you will be to respond to threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/54e15674075490ab53fa650359c9e1a0.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/54e15674075490ab53fa650359c9e1a0.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/54e15674075490ab53fa650359c9e1a0.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTRACURRICULAR ACTIVITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The institute offers many options to polish your magical skills and gain an advantage over your peers. Points may be earned in clubs such as the Duelling Club. Secrets are hidden throughout the institute, often requiring specific spells or potions to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/f66309bd4abd0dbc6173243a396e6a76.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/f66309bd4abd0dbc6173243a396e6a76.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/f66309bd4abd0dbc6173243a396e6a76.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RIGHTEOUS STUDENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The institute imposes strict rules upon all students. Choose your own path as a model student or trouble maker and live with the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/62f402bde65dc21a72776d0083e0298b.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/62f402bde65dc21a72776d0083e0298b.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/62f402bde65dc21a72776d0083e0298b.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been granted the privilege to attend a magical institution as a college age student, but that privilege has to be earned every day. Play with up to 4 players in a team and compete with other teams in magical classes and clubs to earn points for your team. The best teams will be allowed to continue to the next game day and study advanced topics. All other teams will have to return to the first game day and start over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAGICAL CLASSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes are taught and graded by the teachers of the institute. In every class you will learn a new magical skill and then proceed to apply this skill to earn points for your team. The following subjects are taught at the institute</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combative Magic: Learn spells to defend yourself against other witches and wizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemical Studies: Brew magical potions to gain special, temporary buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repulsion of Monsters: Study a variety of monsters that you may face when exploring the institute and learn to repel them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulative Magic: Study magic that allows you to alter the environment to your advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/74ff5ac6d0d1623706c6fecddfe638f3.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/74ff5ac6d0d1623706c6fecddfe638f3.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/74ff5ac6d0d1623706c6fecddfe638f3.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL MAGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <i>no</i> health points. Each spell has a unique effect and you will often have to combine different spells to defeat other players or monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spell has a unique pattern that has to be drawn to cast that spell. There are no short-cuts. The better you master the spell patterns, the faster you will be to respond to threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/54e15674075490ab53fa650359c9e1a0.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/54e15674075490ab53fa650359c9e1a0.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/54e15674075490ab53fa650359c9e1a0.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTRACURRICULAR ACTIVITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The institute offers many options to polish your magical skills and gain an advantage over your peers. Points may be earned in clubs such as the Duelling Club. Secrets are hidden throughout the institute, often requiring specific spells or potions to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/f66309bd4abd0dbc6173243a396e6a76.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/f66309bd4abd0dbc6173243a396e6a76.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/f66309bd4abd0dbc6173243a396e6a76.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RIGHTEOUS STUDENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The institute imposes strict rules upon all students. Choose your own path as a model student or trouble maker and live with the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/62f402bde65dc21a72776d0083e0298b.poster.avif?t=1786437485\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/62f402bde65dc21a72776d0083e0298b.webm?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/extras/62f402bde65dc21a72776d0083e0298b.mp4?t=1786437485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "RIM is a multiplayer game set in a magic school. Compete in teams of 4 players in magical classes to earn points. Attend extracurricular activities and uncover the institute's secrets in your free time to gain an advantage over your peers. Only the best students may continue with their education.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/1f94c82155244a07fd8824dfa40f5ba69990c0bf/header.jpg?t=1786437485", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/74c9e750d20ab93c9f95227c353b414af044172e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786437485", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4487350/74c9e750d20ab93c9f95227c353b414af044172e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786437485", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ether GmbH"], "publishers": ["Ether GmbH"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.ak